---
<section class="sec gutter" id="services" aria-labelledby="sv-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <div><span class="lbl"><b>[ 01 ]</b> What I do</span><h2 id="sv-h">From raw tables to the page a leader opens first.</h2></div>
      <p>Four things, done end to end. The AI does the repetitive work so the hours go into the parts people actually see.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="bento">
      <article class="cell dark c7 rise">
        <div class="cell-top"><span class="num">01 \</span><span class="lbl">Example session</span></div>
        <div><h3>AI-accelerated builds</h3><p class="d" style="margin-top:10px">An agent connected to the semantic model writes measures, relationships and pages. I set the brief and review every change.</p></div>
        <div class="fill"><div class="log">
          <div><span class="k">model</span><span>create measure <span class="ok">[Attrition Rate]</span></span><span class="t">0.8s</span></div>
          <div><span class="k">model</span><span>add relationship fact[DateKey] &rarr; Date[DateKey]</span><span class="t">0.4s</span></div>
          <div><span class="k">report</span><span>write page "Executive summary" &middot; 9 visuals</span><span class="t">3.1s</span></div>
          <div><span class="k">qa</span><span>best-practice rules <span class="ok">48 passed</span></span><span class="t">2.2s</span></div>
        </div></div>
      </article>
      <article class="cell c5 rise">
        <div class="cell-top"><span class="num">02 \</span></div>
        <div><h3>Report design</h3><p class="d" style="margin-top:10px">Native visuals only, formatted until the default look disappears.</p></div>
        <div class="fill"><div class="ba">
          <figure><div class="scr"><span class="def-t">Sum of Revenue by Region</span>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 120 80" aria-hidden="true"><g stroke="#E1DFDD" stroke-width=".6"><line x1="14" y1="10" x2="118" y2="10"/><line x1="14" y1="35" x2="118" y2="35"/><line x1="14" y1="60" x2="118" y2="60"/></g><g fill="#118DFF"><rect x="20" y="18" width="14" height="42"/><rect x="44" y="28" width="14" height="32"/><rect x="68" y="36" width="14" height="24"/><rect x="92" y="44" width="14" height="16"/></g><g font-size="5" fill="#605E5C" font-family="Segoe UI,Arial"><text x="2" y="12">1M</text><text x="0" y="37">0.5M</text><text x="4" y="62">0M</text><text x="20" y="70">East</text><text x="43" y="70">West</text><text x="66" y="70">North</text><text x="90" y="70">South</text></g></svg>
          </div><figcaption>Default</figcaption></figure>
          <figure><div class="scr sel"><span class="tag" aria-hidden="true">Clustered bar</span><span class="h tl"></span><span class="h tr"></span><span class="h bl"></span><span class="h br"></span><span class="new-t">Revenue by region</span>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 120 80" aria-hidden="true"><g font-family="Barlow,Arial" font-size="6.2"><text x="0" y="14" fill="#55555F">East</text><rect x="26" y="8" width="66" height="9" rx="2" fill="#5B3BF5"/><text x="96" y="15" fill="#1B1B1F" font-weight="700">1,240,000</text><text x="0" y="32" fill="#55555F">West</text><rect x="26" y="26" width="49" height="9" rx="2" fill="#D6D6DE"/><text x="79" y="33" fill="#1B1B1F">926,000</text><text x="0" y="50" fill="#55555F">North</text><rect x="26" y="44" width="37" height="9" rx="2" fill="#D6D6DE"/><text x="67" y="51" fill="#1B1B1F">702,000</text><text x="0" y="68" fill="#55555F">South</text><rect x="26" y="62" width="25" height="9" rx="2" fill="#D6D6DE"/><text x="55" y="69" fill="#1B1B1F">468,000</text></g></svg>
          </div><figcaption>Redesigned</figcaption></figure>
        </div></div>
      </article>
      <article class="cell c4 rise">
        <div class="cell-top"><span class="num">03 \</span></div>
        <div><h3>Semantic models</h3><p class="d" style="margin-top:10px">Star schemas with documented measures, ready for Copilot and AI.</p></div>
        <div class="fill"><svg viewBox="0 0 300 150" width="100%" aria-hidden="true" style="font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:9px">
          <g stroke="#B9B9C2" stroke-width="1"><line x1="150" y1="75" x2="56" y2="26"/><line x1="150" y1="75" x2="244" y2="26"/><line x1="150" y1="75" x2="56" y2="124"/><line x1="150" y1="75" x2="244" y2="124"/></g>
          <g fill="#fff" stroke="#D3D3DA"><rect x="8" y="12" width="96" height="28" rx="6"/><rect x="196" y="12" width="96" height="28" rx="6"/><rect x="8" y="110" width="96" height="28" rx="6"/><rect x="196" y="110" width="96" height="28" rx="6"/></g>
          <rect x="92" y="60" width="116" height="30" rx="6" fill="#0A0A0C"/>
          <g fill="#2C2C33"><text x="56" y="30" text-anchor="middle">Date</text><text x="244" y="30" text-anchor="middle">Department</text><text x="56" y="128" text-anchor="middle">Job</text><text x="244" y="128" text-anchor="middle">Location</text></g>
          <text x="150" y="79" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fff">fact_headcount</text>
          <g fill="#5B3BF5"><text x="110" y="52">*</text><text x="184" y="52">*</text><text x="110" y="104">*</text><text x="184" y="104">*</text><text x="96" y="46">1</text><text x="198" y="46">1</text><text x="96" y="108">1</text><text x="198" y="108">1</text></g>
        </svg></div>
      </article>
      <article class="cell violet c4 rise">
        <div class="cell-top"><span class="num">04 \</span></div>
        <div><h3>People analytics</h3><p class="d" style="margin-top:10px">The domain I know best, from HRIS reporting to workforce strategy.</p></div>
        <div class="fill"><div class="chips"><span>Attrition</span><span>Internal mobility</span><span>Succession</span><span>Span of control</span><span>Retirement risk</span><span>Skills gaps</span></div></div>
      </article>
      <article class="cell dark c4 rise">
        <div class="cell-top"><span class="num">05 \</span></div>
        <div><h3>Fabric Apps</h3><p class="d" style="margin-top:10px">Custom apps reading live semantic models, for analysis a report can't hold.</p></div>
        <div class="fill"><svg viewBox="0 0 300 110" width="100%" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 108 H300" stroke="#2C2C34"/><path d="M0 8 H34 V16 H70 V28 H106 V36 H142 V50 H178 V58 H214 V70 H250 V76 H300" fill="none" stroke="#7A61FF" stroke-width="2.5"/><path d="M0 8 H46 V12 H98 V22 H150 V28 H202 V38 H254 V44 H300" fill="none" stroke="#FF6A3D" stroke-width="2.5"/><text x="300" y="94" text-anchor="end" fill="#6E6E79" font-family="Geist Mono,monospace" font-size="10">competing risks</text></svg></div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
